Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:11.72,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Perfect tie-break to seal the deal from Sascha Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫用完美的抢七锁定胜局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:13.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}连救{\fs78}4{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:15.78,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫把胜利抢了回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:18.17,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}13{\fs68}日晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:20.18,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}上海大师赛第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.41,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}兹维列夫迎战布勃利克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:25.00,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}谁能顶住盘末的压力？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:38.46,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, clean as you like that was.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 干净利落的一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:46.86,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, beauty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:57.32,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}首盘救回一个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.67,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}抢七却又{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.67,0:01:02.80,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}布勃利克放短 兹维列夫追到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:05.74,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}截击另一侧 把盘点救回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:26.88,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's missed it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他失误了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:36.64,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's got him!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下这一分！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:51.22,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}From the most perilous of positions in the tie-break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从抢七最危险的处境中逃出生天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.12,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's got it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:08.12,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For just the second time this week, Alexander Zverev is broken.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫本周第二次被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:11.11,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}第二盘 布勃利克掀起反击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:13.77,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}胜负 远没有落定！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:18.72,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's not really pushing off anymore.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他已经不太能蹬地发力了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:45.42,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a sensational point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 这一分太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:04.42,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, nice.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.16,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}决胜盘刚开局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.42,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}兹维列夫先丢发球局 又马上回破
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:13.14,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}双方寸土不让 悬念一直留在最后！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.80,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, brilliant!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:39.25,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}又是抢七！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.25,0:03:42.58,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}先从底线拉开角度 再跟进网前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:45.78,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}兹维列夫 把主动权抢了回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:54.18,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite brilliant.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真是精彩绝伦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:04:06.12,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Perfect tie-break to seal the deal from Sascha Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫用完美的抢七锁定胜局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:13.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}49{\fs68}记制胜分 更少的失误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:16.44,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两个抢七 都被兹维列夫拿下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:19.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}下一轮 德米纳尔能挡住他吗？
